Two-district sail-barge fleet: North Shore and Eastplain each assign 16 sailors to leave their posts and crew the ships. Each one-way trip carries up to 96000 items, arrives in 480 seconds, and completes a round trip in 960 seconds; each run costs {变量1} at both ends.
